  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_602c1f1d-d09b-492f-b9b4-7d4ceca4ed84.png\" alt=\"\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_214edc01-4b4e-44e8-90eb-b9d32d82adc6.png\" alt=\"\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_19c8e8e2-9ae5-4c6c-92d8-a80ec736cb36.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"1450\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1622915/description_9570de5d-06b7-4684-a986-f37e598ff7b6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"1042\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c646592f-d812-44da-892e-317848a89b49.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"497\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8ad3161a-fc66-4b1b-8feb-9991e2bb8829.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"1241\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1622915/description_8ffab155-38a5-4b65-b9a0-d162f16d7d35.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"606\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1622915/description_653af1e6-5bc5-4d74-8c00-4f4a4e14fe8c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"1848\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">Это простой оригинальный ресурс-пак</h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">заменяющий полный набор незерита и многое другое</h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">( пользовательские текстуры требуют <span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>Optifine</strong></span>&nbsp;или&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>EMF</strong>+<strong>ETF</strong></span>&nbsp;)</h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ff80cf\">&hearts; Ни один фламинго не пострадал при создании этого пака &hearts;</span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">Приятной игры!</h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://x.com/rgbBOX07\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1485065/description_4357c94b-ef2b-4954-85a5-e06a5fcae219.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1>",
